 `resolvePointer(document, pointer)` resolves an RFC 6901 JSON Pointer and returns its referenced
 value. It throws when the pointer is malformed or does not identify a value in the document.
+
+## JSON Patch
+
+`applyPatch(document, patch)` applies an RFC 6902 JSON Patch array and returns a new JSON document.
+It implements `add`, `remove`, `replace`, `move`, `copy`, and `test`; malformed patches and failed
+operations throw, and neither the input document nor patch values are mutated.
