+---
+id: task-002-implement-rfc-6902-json-patch
+type: task
+title: "Implement RFC 6902 JSON Patch"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Work performed
+
+Implemented and exported `applyPatch(document, patch)` with RFC 6902 `add`, `remove`, `replace`,
+`move`, `copy`, and `test` operations. The implementation validates JSON values and patch operation
+members, uses RFC 6901 token decoding, preserves the source document through deep cloning, and
+rejects malformed or unsuccessful operations.
+
+Added deterministic tests covering every operation, escaped paths, root replacement, array append,
+non-mutation, and representative invalid patches. Updated the README API documentation.
